{"version":1,"id":"olivia-rodrigo-making-the-bed","title":"Making The Bed","artist":"Olivia Rodrigo","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/olivia-rodrigo/making-the-bed/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Daniel Leonard Nigro and Olivia Isabel Rodrigo","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Want it, so I got it, did it, so it's done","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Another thing I ruined, I used to do for fun","columns":44,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Another piece of plastic I could just throw away","columns":48,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Another conversation with nothing good to say","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"I thought it, so I said it, took it 'cause I can","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Another day pretending I'm older than I am","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Another perfect moment that doesn't feel like mine","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Another thing I forced to be a sign","columns":35,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":1,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"Well, sometimes I feel like I don't wanna be where I am","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":54,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Getting drunk at a club with my fair-weather friends","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Push away all the people who know me the best","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":41,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"But it's me who's been making the bed","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":34,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm so tired of being the girl that I am","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":39,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Every good thing has turned into something I dread","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm playing the victim so well in my head","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":41,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"But it's me who's been making the bed","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":34,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Me who's been makin' the bed","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":25,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Pull the sheets over my head, yeah","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Makin' the bed","columns":14,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"And every night, I wake up from this one recurrin' dream","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":4,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Where I'm drivin' through the city, and the brakes go out on me","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"I can't stop at the red light, can't swerve off the road","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"I read somewhere it's 'cause my life feels so out of control","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"And I tell someone I love them just as a distraction","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"They tell me that they love me like I'm some tourist attraction","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"They're changin' my machinery, and I just let it happen","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"I got the things I wanted, it's just not what I imagined","columns":56,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":2,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"Well, sometimes I feel like I don't wanna be where I am","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Gettin' drunk at a club with my fair-weather friends","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":45,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Push away all the people wh